<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 34, left: 40, width: 1200 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>下一步：按"素材密度"排，不按文档编号排</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>先把最厚的写完，后面的都是截取与录制 —— 顺序错了会反复返工</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 138, left: 40, width: 1200 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 8 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#0E3F8C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 12 }}>项目详细方案</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    五层管线 + 三模块 + 全部实测数据。素材最多，先写它，后面几份都从这份截。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>预计篇幅最大</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 12 }}>项目概要介绍</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    从详细方案压缩成 2~3 页：问题、方案、指标、创新点。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>依赖第 1 步</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 12 }}>关键模块说明</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    三个创新点各一页：机制 + 为什么有效 + 实测证据。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>≤ 3 个创新点</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>4</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 12 }}>项目简介 PPT</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    本次组会这版就是雏形，补截图与演示录屏即可定稿。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>已有雏形</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#0E3F8C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>5</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 12 }}>演示视频</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    演示链路现成：导入 → 三线提取 → 入库 → 填表 → 下载。录屏 + 剪辑。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>最后做</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 400, left: 40, width: 1200 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #C9D8EC', padding: '26px 28px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>时间安排（按组会后启动）</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>阶段一</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 2 }}>详细方案 + 概要介绍</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>阶段二</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 2 }}>关键模块说明 + PPT 定稿</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>阶段三</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 2 }}>演示视频录制 + 打包提交</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 18, borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                需要导师拍板的两件事：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>① 创新点选哪三个最站得住；② 演示视频重点演示哪条链路。</span>
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, bottom: 56, width: 1200, background: '#FFF8E1', border: '1px solid #F0DCA8', padding: '12px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A6D1F' }}>
            风险提示：演示视频依赖稳定的录屏环境，建议定稿前先试录一遍；PPT 里的截图取自本机真实运行界面，比赛前可再更新一版。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, bottom: 20, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>A-23 基于大语言模型的文档理解与多源数据融合系统</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>21 / 22</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
